{"id":"wb-5-65","name":"贾湖遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"賈湖遺址","text":"贾湖遗址是9000年至7700年前的新石器时代裴李岗文化文化遗址，位于中国河南省漯河市舞阳县北舞渡镇西南1.5公里的贾湖村，面积约55000平方米。出土了现在仍可吹奏的五声至七音阶骨笛、具有早期文字性质的甲骨契刻符号、粟及稻栽培遗迹、中国最早的家猪、人工酿酒遗迹等，于2001年被列入全国重点文物保护单位，编号5-65。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%B3%88%E6%B9%96%E9%81%BA%E5%9D%80","revisionId":92380788,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92380788","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/3d90406a6c21dbf8741c69a3.jpg","title":"Neolithic_bone_flute.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Neolithic_bone_flute.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5d/Neolithic_bone_flute.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"asgitner","license":"CC BY-SA 2.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0","caption":"Neolithic bone flute (Henan Provincial Museum)","width":320,"height":240}}